## Whole-kernel totals (for reference)
`132 MUFU.EX2` (66 prologue peel + 66 steady-state), `48 HGMMA` (8×QK 64x128 + a 16-PV steady + 8×QK prologue + 16-PV prologue + 16-PV epilogue at 0x71a0), `64 LDGSTS.E.BYPASS.128`, `96 F2FP.BF16.F32.PACK_AB`, `20 SHFL (12 BFLY + 8 IDX)`, `8 SYNCS.PHASECHK TRYWAIT`, `2 SYNCS.ARRIVE`, `2 ARRIVES.LDGSTSBAR`, `7 SYNCS.EXCH.64` (mbarrier init), `8 MUFU.RCP`, `2 MUFU.LG2`.

### One-line diff-ready summary of the CONSUMER steady-state iteration
`24 HGMMA (8× 64x128x16 QK + 16× 64x64x16 PV.tnspB)` · `66 MUFU.EX2` · `32 F2FP pack` · `4 SHFL.BFLY` · `76 FMNMX / 72 FADD / 68 FMUL / 66 FFMA` · `2 WARPGROUP.ARRIVE + 2 WARPGROUP.DEPBAR.LE` · `1 BAR.SYNC.DEFER_BLOCKING(R18,256) + 1 BAR.ARV(R9,256)` · `1 mbarrier TRYWAIT + 1 mbarrier ARRIVE` · **0 LDGSTS / 0 LDSM / 0 LDS** (descriptor-based GMMA). Producer is separate: **32× LDGSTS.128 CG + 1 LDGSTSBAR arrive** per stage.
